and following paragraph"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"335–336"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"355–356"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{KLRandom}\">\\(\\operatorname{KLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c9a802fc6a847063\" href=\"?note=c9a802fc6a847063\" title=\"43-df-nonmonotonic-betting\">43-df-nonmonotonic-betting</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52fd5856a06d2543\" href=\"?note=52fd5856a06d2543\" title=\"43-df-comprandom\">43-df-comprandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\right)\\land\\left(\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\right)\\land\\left(\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一个非单调策略达到2^n资本的有限玩法给有效开集，公平性给测度界，从而由ML检验阻止成功。反向蕴含仅指KL到可计算随机性，因为单调扫描是特例；没有把草稿Question12.4.6的KL到ML问题当作定理或声明其当前研究状态。核对来源陈述，未独立重证实值有效下注的完整转换。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 12.4.5 and following paragraph；印刷页335–336，PDF页355–356。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nonmonotonic-betting","status":"resolved","id":"c9a802fc6a847063","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nonmonotonic-betting]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-comprandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{KLRandom}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-nonmonotonic-betting]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nonmonotonic-betting","status":"resolved","id":"c9a802fc6a847063","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{KLRandom}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-nonmonotonic-betting]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-comprandom","status":"resolved","id":"52fd5856a06d2543","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{KLRandom}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-nonmonotonic-betting]]、[[43-df-comprandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{KLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\right)\\land\\left(\\operatorname{KLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ComputableRandom}(X)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kl-properties]] — Kolmogorov–Loveland随机性的基本蕴含"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","c9a802fc6a847063","52fd5856a06d2543"]}